{"title": "Global Websites Offline Due to PHP Vulnerability", "summary": "Websites worldwide, including government sites in Canada and Europe, were taken offline as a precautionary measure due to a serious vulnerability discovered in the PHP computer language. This language is used to build approximately 70% of the world's websites. While the specific extent of exploitation is being investigated, Amazon reported experiencing attacks before the vulnerability was publicly disclosed. Governments and companies are working to identify their exposure and protect their systems.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "PHP भेद्यता के कारण वैश्विक वेबसाइटें ऑफ़लाइन", "summary_hi": "PHP कंप्यूटर भाषा में एक गंभीर भेद्यता की खोज के कारण दुनिया भर की वेबसाइटें, जिनमें कनाडा और यूरोप की सरकारी वेबसाइटें भी शामिल हैं, एहतियाती उपाय के तौर पर ऑफ़लाइन कर दी गईं। इस भाषा का उपयोग दुनिया की लगभग 70% वेबसाइटों के निर्माण में होता है। हालांकि शोषण की विशिष्ट सीमा की जांच की जा रही है, अमेज़ॅन ने भेद्यता के सार्वजनिक होने से पहले हमलों का अनुभव करने की सूचना दी। सरकारें और कंपनियां अपने एक्सपोजर की पहचान करने और अपनी प्रणालियों की सुरक्षा के लिए काम कर रही हैं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasizes the global scale of the shutdown, noting websites around the world went dark.", "Highlights that bad actors could exploit the vulnerability in the language used by 70% of sites."], "center": ["Focuses on the precautionary shutdown of government websites in various regions, including Canada and Europe.", "Mentions Amazon experienced attacks before the warning was made public.", "Explains what PHP is and why it led to government websites going offline."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["दुनिया भर में शटडाउन के वैश्विक पैमाने पर जोर देता है, यह देखते हुए कि दुनिया भर की वेबसाइटें डार्क हो गईं।", "इस बात पर प्रकाश डालता है कि दुर्भावनापूर्ण कर्ता 70% साइटों द्वारा उपयोग की जाने वाली भाषा में भेद्यता का फायदा उठा सकते हैं।"], "center": ["कनाडा और यूरोप सहित विभिन्न क्षेत्रों में सरकारी वेबसाइटों के एहतियाती शटडाउन पर केंद्रित है।", "उल्लेख करता है कि चेतावनी के सार्वजनिक होने से पहले अमेज़ॅन ने हमलों का अनुभव किया।", "बताता है कि PHP क्या है और इसने सरकारी वेबसाइटों को ऑफ़लाइन क्यों कर दिया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/10/22/1600x900/logo/php_1792638747989_Hp5B_1792638764595_720I_ba1c7390-1f16-4eba-8f86-890ea4546507_ke2i.png", "sources": [{"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/php2shell-vulnerability-most-significant-security-issues-how-google-openai-and-amazon-respond-to-the-cyber-threat-11792631464039.html", "headline": "PHP2Shell vulnerability: ‘Most significant security issues…,’ How Google, OpenAI and Amazon respond to the cyber threat", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPQ2NPSkJQaVJBS0ZaZDYzTWR0Z1F6Y1VoUnBmWFpzMEtpSnFiWkdkQk1yT2RKaWJFbFpaRkZFUmJPUERFS0U0dUdHZjNseDFkTkt4Y3ZhT19aZjFGY0RlOUpjU1EwMVp1dy1ZMDNZellhdTZmQnRvZ21HQ2JhN1EwZ1dJZ1ZoUXJrMk5Qeg?oc=5", "headline": "Websites taken offline over PHP risks", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "BBC News", "owner": "BBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmx23d0k57d3o", "headline": "UK working to identify exposure after global cyber-security warning", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "The Guardian", "owner": "The Guardian", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/21/flaw-in-php-computer-language-leads-to-shutdown-of-websites-around-world", "headline": "Flaw in PHP computer language leads to shutdown of websites around world", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "CBC News", "owner": "CBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX